<section id="shelf" class="py-20 sm:py-28 border-y border-bord-light dark:border-[#222] bg-white/50 dark:bg-[#111]/50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_1fr] gap-8 lg:gap-20 items-end mb-12">
      <div>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-accent mb-5" data-i18n="shelf.label">新功能 · 截图暂存栏</p>
        <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-tight whitespace-pre-line" data-i18n="shelf.title">先收集，<br />再一次分享。</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-lg text-mute dark:text-[#aaa] leading-relaxed max-w-xl" data-i18n="shelf.desc">截三张，标三张，最后只切一次应用。把一组反馈、Bug 复现步骤或给 AI Agent 的图片上下文放在一起。</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="mb-12">
      <div class="p-3 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#eeece8] dark:bg-[#1b1b1b] border border-bord-light dark:border-[#2a2a2a]">
        <img src="/screenshots/screenshot-shelf-light.jpg" alt="截图暂存栏内的三张演示截图，以及继续截图、复制、删除和拖出按钮" data-i18n-alt="shelf.imageAlt" width="1360" height="554" class="block dark:hidden w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-lg" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/screenshots/screenshot-shelf-dark.jpg" alt="截图暂存栏内的三张演示截图，以及继续截图、复制、删除和拖出按钮" data-i18n-alt="shelf.imageAlt" width="1360" height="554" class="hidden dark:block w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-lg" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <figcaption class="mt-4 text-xs text-mute dark:text-[#999]" data-i18n="shelf.caption">macOS 原生界面实拍 · 内含演示图片</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <ol class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12">
      {[1, 2, 3].map((step) => (
        <li class="border-t border-bord-light dark:border-[#333] pt-5">
          <span class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">0{step}</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-3 mb-2" data-i18n={`shelf.step${step}`}>{['截图并标注', '加入暂存，继续截', '整组交付'][step - 1]}</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-mute dark:text-[#aaa] leading-relaxed" data-i18n={`shelf.detail${step}`}>{['用箭头、文字或模糊标出重点。', '按 ⌘Return 收好这一张，接着截下一张。', '复制全部或拖出整组，再切换到目标应用。'][step - 1]}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-16">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2" data-i18n="shelf.controls">顺手整理，再交出去</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-mute dark:text-[#aaa] leading-relaxed" data-i18n="shelf.controlDesc">拖动排序，空格预览；每张可单独移除，也能一键清空。关闭窗口或重启 App，暂存内容仍保留。</p>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-mute dark:text-[#aaa] leading-relaxed" data-i18n="shelf.note">多图粘贴取决于目标应用。复制全部使用 PNG 文件；请核对附件数量。也可整组拖入，或合成一张图片。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
